[00:30.00] Autumn has come to rest
[00:38.00] And her garden
[00:41.00] Come to paint the trees with emptiness
[00:48.00] And no pardon
[00:52.00] So many things have come undone
[00:58.00] Like the leaves on the ground
[01:01.00] And suddenly, she begins to cry
[01:08.00] But she doesn't know why
[01:13.00] Heavy are the words that fall through the air
[01:29.00] Too burdened her shoulders
